	(text "*Pololu and AliExpress Modules include 20K SMD resistor on board (Quad-Level 2)\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 72.898 41.91 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1d34a27f-1f59-4728-9985-172bfd8468b5")
	)
	(text "Alternative 2: DRV8871\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 134.112 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(thickness 0.508)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3944f981-77f1-4a36-aabb-626a479cd300")
	)
	(text "*Quad-Level 2 is choosen to facilitate inrush protection (3µs pulses)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 72.644 39.116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4d69c568-a64a-49bb-a36a-1d32f78fc752")
	)
	(text "Alternative 1: DRV8876"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.666 117.856 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(thickness 0.508)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5dbd82ba-8140-4685-aca5-4a8428cc9181")
	)
	(text "*Adafruit and AliExpress DRV8871 Modules include a 30 KΩ on board SMD resistor between ILIM and GND\nThis gives a current limit of approximately 2A\nDRV8871 modules have a different (larger) footprint, and do not support a nFault output.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 138.938 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7598d600-5559-4c50-9e74-2bd67cccd394")
	)
	(text "Formula: ITRIP (A) x AIPROPI (μA/A) = VVREF (V) / RIPROPI (Ω) \nDRV8874: AIPROPI = 450 μA/A\nDRV8876: AIPROPI = 1000 μA/A\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8bee70e6-1ce2-499f-a927-7176305612c8")
	)
	(text "Also these modules include a 2,49 KΩ on board SMD resistor between IPROPI and GND\nFor the DRV8876 AIPROPI is 1000uA/A.\nWith Vref = 3V3, this results into an ITRIP value of 1,35A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.666 122.174 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a397a2a2-a891-49b8-b97f-44496bcff70b")
	)
	(text "*DRV8871: only PWM\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.018 38.862 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dccc8630-c4b0-4be9-9aec-f0228d062803")
	)
	(text "*Pololu and AliExpress Modules include a 2,49 KΩ on board SMD resistor between IPROPI and GND.\nThis resistor may be replaced to obtain other Itrip / Vsense values. See table below.\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.412 107.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "de590fb9-6a56-459c-9479-c7b5cf9b201a")
	)
	(text "Optionally a snubber circuit and/or a series inductor of 4.7 to 10 µH may be connected at the DCC output connector.\nThe snubber circuit consists of a 100 nF capacitor in series with a 10-47 Ω resistor, connected in parallel across \nboth DCC output lines. Its primary purpose is to protect the H-bridge from voltage spikes caused by inductive \nkickback at each switching moment. A secondary effect is reduction of ringing on the DCC signal.\nIf both are used, the snubber must be placed closest to the H-bridge, followed by the series inductor. \nThe inductor limits inrush current caused by track and decoder capacitance. Note that the inductor significantly \nincreases inductive kickback voltage - the snubber is then essential.\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 120.904 79.502 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f35a3154-053e-470e-b353-fca88019cf4f")
	)
